Third-party data keeps its own licence (full credits in README.md):

- src/assets/mocap.js: adapted from the Bandai Namco Research Motion Dataset,
  CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial). This is why the game as distributed is free
  and non-commercial.
- src/assets/strokes.js: adapted from Tennis-MoCap (Pulgarin-Giraldo et al.),
  CC BY-SA 3.0. This file is shared under the same licence.
- src/assets/body-*.json, src/assets/crowd-*.json, src/assets/kit/: built from
  MakeHuman data (base mesh, skeleton, weights, clothes, hair, skin textures and
  facial expression units), CC0 1.0.
- Lighting (image-based): Poly Haven HDRIs (park, sunset, night), CC0 1.0,
  through the @pmndrs/assets npm package (CC0 1.0).
- src/assets/calls.js, src/assets/commentary.js: speech rendered offline with
  the Piper text-to-speech engine (GPL-3.0, not included in the game) using a
  voice model trained on LibriTTS, CC BY 4.0.
